{"id":"HKF-094","kind":"appraisal","key":"D03","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Reports 3 DJI Manifold UAVs, EC (dual Xeon 4210R + RTX 4080), Ubuntu 20.04/PyTorch, 4 DNNs, 5 resolutions, 20,000 episodes, 2x128 MLP, gamma=0.98, and failure ranges; omits Emax_n, penalty Pu, bandwidth Wn, transmit power pn, and default Tmax.","evidence":[{"page":10,"section":"VI.A. Experimental Setup","quote":"The MARL models are trained through 20,000 episodes,"},{"page":10,"section":"VI.A. Experimental Setup","quote":"layers of 128 neurons each. ReLU serves as"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-094","kind":"appraisal","key":"D04","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"YES: Compares RUVA against MBF [5], SOA [2], static cloud/edge bounds (CSL, CLH, ESL, ELH), and two ablations (NMN without mixing network, IPG with individual policy gradients) under the same profiled setup and delay thresholds (0.2-0.6 s).","evidence":[{"page":11,"section":"VI.A. Experimental Setup","quote":"To validate our proposed algorithm, we introduce four"},{"page":12,"section":"VI.C. Ablation Experiments","quote":"baseline algorithms: no mixing network algorithm (NMN)"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-094","kind":"appraisal","key":"D05","status":"VERIFIED","finding":"YES: Evaluated metrics (task delay, original accuracy, reliable rate, and inference accuracy IAn(t)) directly match the optimization objective maximizing long-term average inference accuracy under delay and energy constraints.","evidence":[{"page":6,"section":"IV.A. Problem Formulation","quote":"The optimization objective is to maximize the inference"},{"page":11,"section":"VI.B. Performance Analysis","quote":"accuracy, reliable rate and inference accuracy. As shown"}],"note":""}
