{"id":"HKF-028","kind":"appraisal","key":"D08","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Section 6.3 acknowledges LLMs significantly increase computational consumption and processing time, yet Section 7 overstates this as maintaining competitive task processing time and generalizes from a 20mx20m grid simulation to Industry 5.0 deployments.","evidence":[{"page":18,"section":"6.3 Performance Comparison of Different Methods","quote":"they significantly increase computational consumption and"},{"page":20,"section":"7 CONCLUSION","quote":"while maintaining a competitive task processing time. Besides,"}],"note":""}
