{"id":"HKF-029","kind":"appraisal","key":"D07","status":"NO","finding":"NO: Evaluated solely in MATLAB and Microsoft AirSim simulations on one desktop PC (RTX 3090Ti); no wireless channel, packet loss, bandwidth, flight-controller/hardware-in-the-loop, battery, or real-world UAV flight testing is modeled or performed.","evidence":[{"page":4,"section":"4 Experience","quote":"The simulation environment was based on Microsoft AirSim,"},{"page":5,"section":"5 Conclusion","quote":"In the future work, we plan to validate"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-029","kind":"appraisal","key":"D08","status":"PARTIAL","finding":"PARTIAL: Conclusions summarize MATLAB/AirSim simulation gains and acknowledge omitted details and lack of real-world validation, though text mixes UTTUT/TTUTU naming and claims practical security/reliability of centralized LLMs beyond tested simulation scope.","evidence":[{"page":5,"section":"4.2 Multi-Agent Cooperative Task Planning Experiments","quote":"centralized frameworks are likely to remain more reliable"},{"page":5,"section":"5 Conclusion","quote":"We propose the TTUTU multi-agent collaboration framework and"}],"note":""}
{"id":"HKF-029","kind":"appraisal","key":"D09","status":"NOT_REPORTED","finding":"NOT_REPORTED: Checked Section 4, Section 5, and References; no author code repository, trained PPO weights, AirSim scripts, or prompt files are released or linked (prompts and training parameters are explicitly omitted due to space constraints).","evidence":[{"page":5,"section":"5 Conclusion","quote":"parameters, training procedures, and the prompts in each"}],"note":""}
